Widgets update on their own. The pair widget used to change only text on the home screen: status, mood, music. Your partner's photo and avatar arrived only when you opened the app, which is why so many of you were stuck with the very first picture. Now the widget collects photos, avatars and names in the background.

Each couple has its own data. Widgets of different couples used to share one set of keys, so the wrong pair could show up on your home screen.

Adding a photo to a widget no longer hangs. Image compression now has a time limit, and if saving fails the app says so instead of spinning forever.
